```

**Description**

```text
A VS Code extension for authors, worldbuilders, and storytellers.
```

**Entry point**

```text
extension.js
```

(If you're using TypeScript with the VS Code extension generator, this is less important because the build outputs to `out/extension.js`.)

**Test command**

```text
```

(Leave blank.)

**Git repository**

```text
https://github.com/<your-github-username>/uriel-platform.git
```

(or leave blank if you haven't created the repository yet.)

**Keywords**

```text
vscode,writing,author,markdown,worldbuilding,storytelling,lore,fantasy,novel,codex
```

**Author**

```text
Your Name
```

**License**

```text
